  "final_text": "New chat\nImages\nPlugins\nDeep research\nSee plans and pricing\nHelp\nSettings\nGet responses tailored to you\n\nLog in to get answers based on saved chats, plus create images and upload files.\n\nLog in\nChatGPT\nLog in\nSign up for free\nYou said:\n\nhii\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHii! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a How are you doing? What can I help you with today?\n\nYou said:\n\nhwllo my name is reo\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHello, Reo! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a Nice to meet you! How\u2019s your day going?\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats your name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI'm ChatGPT! \ud83e\udd16\u2728 You can call me ChatGPT, or give me a nickname if you want \ud83d\ude04\n\nNice to meet you, Reo! \ud83d\udc4b\n\nYou said:\n\nsuper tell mee the 20 best tamil movies\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nAbsolutely, Reo! \ud83d\ude0e\ud83c\udfac If we're talking about 20 of the best Tamil movies ever, I'd pick a mix of classics, critically acclaimed films, mass entertainers, and modern masterpieces:\n\n\ud83c\udfad Nayakan (1987) \u2014 Kamal Haasan\n\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Anbe Sivam (2003) \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Madhavan\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Paruthiveeran (2007) \u2014 Karthi, Priyamani\n\n\u2764\ufe0f 96 (2018) \u2014 Vijay Sethupathi, Trisha\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Vikram Vedha (2017) \u2014 Madhavan, Vijay Sethupathi\n\n\ud83d\ude82 Aaranya Kaandam (2011) \u2014 Jackie Shroff, Ravi Krishna\n\n\ud83c\udfc6\n\nChatGPT is AI and can make mistakes.\n\nChat with ChatGPT",
